{"seq":1,"slug":"pbt-principles","title":"属性测试的核心原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/foundations/pbt-principles","wordCount":1707,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"属性测试的核心原理\">属性测试的核心原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>属性测试的三个核心要素：<strong>属性</strong>（对所有输入必须成立的不变量）、<strong>生成器</strong>（自动构造满足类型约束的随机输入）、<strong>收缩器</strong>（将反例最小化为最简可重现形式）。这三者构成了从 QuickCheck 到 Hypothesis 的统一范式基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从举例测试到属性测试的范式跃迁\">从举例测试到属性测试的范式跃迁</h2><p>传统单元测试遵循&quot;给定输入 X，预期输出 Y&quot;的存在量化模式（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exists</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span></span></span></span></span>）：开发者为每个场景手工构造一组具体的输入-输出对。这种方法的根本局限在于覆盖范围受限于人的想象力——你只能测到你&quot;想到&quot;的场景。</p>\n<p>属性测试（Property-Based Testing, PBT）将测试的量化级别提升到全称量化（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span></span></span></span></span>）：开发者定义一个必须对所有合法输入成立的<em>属性</em>（不变量），测试框架自动生成数百乃至数千个随机输入来尝试反驳（falsify）该属性。如果框架在大量尝试后无法找到反例，我们对属性成立的信心就会增长。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 举例测试：验证 3 个我想到的场景&#10;def test_sort_examples():&#10;    assert sort([3, 1, 2]) == [1, 2, 3]&#10;    assert sort([]) == []&#10;    assert sort([1]) == [1]&#10;&#10;# 属性测试：验证对所有输入成立的不变量&#10;@given(st.lists(st.integers()))&#10;def test_sort_is_ordered(xs):&#10;    result = sort(xs)&#10;    assert all(result[i] &lt;= result[i+1] for i in range(len(result)-1))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 举例测试：验证 3 个我想到的场景</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_sort_examples</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sort([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sort([]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sort([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 属性测试：验证对所有输入成立的不变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(st.lists(st.integers()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_sort_is_ordered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sort(xs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result[i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两种方法的区别不在于测试用例的<em>数量</em>，而在于测试的<em>认知模型</em>。举例测试回答&quot;这几个场景对吗？&quot;，属性测试回答&quot;是否存在反例？&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"quickcheck-的历史与理论基础\">QuickCheck 的历史与理论基础</h2><p>属性测试的理论根基可追溯到 2000 年 Koen Claessen 和 John Hughes 发表的开创性论文《QuickCheck: A Lightweight Tool for Random Testing of Haskell Programs》。这篇论文提出了一个简洁而深刻的洞见：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>与其为每个函数编写具体的测试用例，不如描述函数必须满足的<em>属性</em>，然后让机器自动检验。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>QuickCheck 的核心架构由三个组件构成：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[定义属性] --&gt; B[生成随机输入]&#10;    B --&gt; C{属性成立?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[继续生成更多输入]&#10;    D --&gt; E{达到 max_examples?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[测试通过]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| B&#10;    C --&gt;|否| G[收缩反例]&#10;    G --&gt; H[报告最小反例]\">flowchart TD\n    A[定义属性] --&gt; B[生成随机输入]\n    B --&gt; C{属性成立?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[继续生成更多输入]\n    D --&gt; E{达到 max_examples?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[测试通过]\n    E --&gt;|否| B\n    C --&gt;|否| G[收缩反例]\n    G --&gt; H[报告最小反例]</pre><p>QuickCheck 的设计哲学基于几个关键假设：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>假设</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>工程影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>小范围假设（Small Scope Hypothesis）</td>\n<td>大多数 bug 可以用小输入触发</td>\n<td>不需要极大的输入就能发现问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>耦合效应假设</td>\n<td>复杂 bug 由简单缺陷组合而成</td>\n<td>测试简单属性就能暴露组合缺陷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性即规格</td>\n<td>好的属性本身就是形式化规格的轻量替代</td>\n<td>属性测试同时是文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反例最小化</td>\n<td>最小反例比原始随机输入更易于调试</td>\n<td>收缩器是核心而非附加功能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"属性的形式化定义与分类\">属性的形式化定义与分类</h2><p>从形式化角度，一个属性可以定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Property</mtext><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>Gen</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>true</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Property}: \\forall x \\in \\text{Gen}(T). \\; P(x) = \\text{true}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Property</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Gen</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">true</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Gen</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Gen}(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Gen</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 上的生成器，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是待验证的谓词。属性测试框架通过采样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Gen</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Gen}(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Gen</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 中的大量值来近似验证全称量化命题。</p>\n<p>属性按其认知来源可分为四个层次：</p>\n<p><strong>代数属性</strong>：源自数学结构的代数法则。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>交换律：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(a, b) = f(b, a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>结合律：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(f(a, b), c) = f(a, f(b, c))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>单位元：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(a, e) = a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>契约属性</strong>：源自函数的前置/后置条件。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>前置条件满足时函数不抛异常</li>\n<li>输出满足某个值域约束</li>\n<li>返回值与输入满足特定关系</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>关系属性</strong>：源自多个函数间的关系。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>往返性（round-trip）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>decode</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>encode</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{decode}(\\text{encode}(x)) = x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">decode</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">encode</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>等价性（equivalence）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{new}}(x) = f_{\\text{old}}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>对偶性（duality）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>reverse</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>reverse</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{reverse}(\\text{reverse}(x)) = x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reverse</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reverse</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>不变量属性</strong>：源自数据结构必须维护的内部一致性。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>排序后相邻元素有序</li>\n<li>平衡树的高度约束：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h \\leq \\lceil \\log_2(n+1) \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)⌉</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>集合操作后无重复元素</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"属性测试与形式化验证的关系\">属性测试与形式化验证的关系</h2><p>属性测试处于测试谱系的特定位置——它比举例测试强，但比形式化证明弱：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>保证级别</th>\n<th>适用性</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>举例测试</td>\n<td>有限点验证</td>\n<td>任意系统</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性测试</td>\n<td>概率性验证（高置信度）</td>\n<td>可定义生成器的系统</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型检测</td>\n<td>有限状态空间穷举</td>\n<td>有界系统</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定理证明</td>\n<td>数学确定性保证</td>\n<td>可形式化的系统</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>属性测试的实用价值在于它处在&quot;保证级别&quot;与&quot;实施成本&quot;的甜蜜点——它能发现举例测试遗漏的 bug，而成本远低于形式化方法。在工程实践中，属性测试并非形式化验证的替代，而是其<em>渐进逼近</em>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>属性在 </mtext><mi>n</mi><mtext> 次测试中未被反驳</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mtext>属性为假</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} P(\\text{属性在 } n \\text{ 次测试中未被反驳} \\mid \\text{属性为假}) = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.45em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">lim</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">属性在</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">次测试中未被反驳</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">属性为假</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即随着测试次数增长，&quot;属性为假但未被检测到&quot;的概率趋近于零（假设生成器的覆盖率足够好）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"属性测试的局限与应对\">属性测试的局限与应对</h2><p>属性测试并非万能。其核心局限包括：</p>\n<p><strong>属性发现问题</strong>：定义好的属性需要对被测系统的语义有深入理解。一个过弱的属性（如&quot;函数不崩溃&quot;）几乎不提供有用信息；一个过强的属性可能本身就是完整实现的重写。</p>\n<p><strong>生成器偏差</strong>：默认生成器可能无法覆盖特定的边界区域。例如，均匀分布的整数生成器可能很少生成刚好在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>31</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{31} - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">31</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 附近的值——而那恰恰是整数溢出 bug 的栖息地。</p>\n<p><strong>Oracle 问题</strong>：某些系统没有已知的属性可以验证。对于&quot;给定输入图像，输出美学评分&quot;这类函数，很难定义超越&quot;不崩溃&quot;的有意义属性。</p>\n<p><strong>执行成本</strong>：属性测试通常需要执行数百次被测函数。对于慢函数（如涉及网络 I/O 或数据库操作），这可能导致不可接受的测试时间。</p>\n<p>应对策略包括：使用条件属性（<code>assume</code>）过滤不满足前置条件的输入；为关键边界区域定制生成器；使用参考实现（oracle）作为属性的对照基准；通过 <code>max_examples</code> 参数在覆盖度与执行时间之间取得平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>属性测试将测试的认知模型从&quot;验证有限个场景&quot;提升到&quot;对所有输入验证不变量&quot;。其理论基础源自 2000 年的 QuickCheck 论文，核心组件为属性定义、随机生成和反例收缩。属性测试处于举例测试与形式化验证之间的甜蜜点——它能发现人类直觉盲区中的 bug，而成本远低于证明。理解属性的形式化定义（全称量化的谓词）和分类体系（代数属性、契约属性、关系属性、不变量属性）是编写有效属性测试的前提。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>sibling-link</strong>: 掌握原理后，下一步需要理解属性测试的引擎——生成器与收缩器如何工作。见 <a href=\"generators-shrinking\">生成器与收缩器机制</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"属性测试的核心原理","id":"属性测试的核心原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从举例测试到属性测试的范式跃迁","id":"从举例测试到属性测试的范式跃迁"},{"level":2,"text":"QuickCheck 的历史与理论基础","id":"quickcheck-的历史与理论基础"},{"level":2,"text":"属性的形式化定义与分类","id":"属性的形式化定义与分类"},{"level":2,"text":"属性测试与形式化验证的关系","id":"属性测试与形式化验证的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"属性测试的局限与应对","id":"属性测试的局限与应对"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"生成器与收缩器机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/foundations/generators-shrinking"}}